- Reliable opening and closing of the bin lid.

## 7. Safety Precautions

- Check the wiring before supplying power.
- Use the correct voltage for each component.
- Avoid short circuits.
- Use a separate power supply for the servo when necessary.
- Ensure all components have a common ground where required.

## 8. Conclusion

The hardware system provides the physical foundation for the Smart Recycle Bin. By combining sensors, a microcontroller, a camera, and a motor, the project aims to make waste disposal more intelligent and automatic.
